{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/returning-an-online-order-at-a-shop/audio/main-e64467ff32d6.mp3","durationSec":110.856,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.24,"text":"Before you go to the shop, collect your evidence."},{"start":2.9,"end":6.24,"text":"You need the order confirmation email or a printed order number."},{"start":6.84,"end":10.84,"text":"You also need the original packaging if you still have it, and the item itself."},{"start":11.8,"end":15,"text":"Many shops also ask for the card or account you used to pay."},{"start":15.76,"end":19.16,"text":"For example, Yuki received a jacket in the wrong size."},{"start":19.78,"end":23.58,"text":"She took her phone to the shop and showed the assistant her order confirmation email."},{"start":24.4,"end":26.24,"text":"The assistant scanned the order number immediately."},{"start":26.74,"end":29.44,"text":"Without that number, the return would have taken much longer."},{"start":30.34,"end":34.7,"text":"Always check the shop's own return policy for the exact documents they need."},{"start":35.44,"end":37.76,"text":"Keep your explanation short and specific."},{"start":38.56,"end":41.84,"text":"Say what is wrong, not just that you are unhappy."},{"start":42.88,"end":45.58,"text":"Use these patterns: \"The item is damaged.\","},{"start":46.38,"end":47.96,"text":"\"The colour is different from the website.\","},{"start":48.78,"end":50.44,"text":"\"I received the wrong size.\","},{"start":50.44,"end":53.76,"text":"or \"It stopped working after one use.\""},{"start":53.76,"end":58.8,"text":"For example, Carlos opened his headphones and found the left side had no sound."},{"start":59.32,"end":63.18,"text":"He said to the assistant, \"I bought these online and the left side doesn't work."},{"start":63.72,"end":65.12,"text":"I only used them once.\""},{"start":65.7,"end":69.44,"text":"That one clear sentence gave the assistant everything needed to start the return."},{"start":70,"end":73.66,"text":"Avoid long stories; one or two sentences are enough."},{"start":74.6,"end":77.7,"text":"Once you have explained the problem, ask what options are available."},{"start":78.38,"end":82.7,"text":"Two simple questions cover most situations: \"Is it possible to get a refund?\""},{"start":83.32,"end":85.62,"text":"and \"Can I exchange this for the correct size?\""},{"start":86.46,"end":90.2,"text":"If you are not sure which you prefer, ask: \"What are my options?\""},{"start":90.92,"end":92.7,"text":"Always ask how the money is returned."},{"start":93.44,"end":97.04,"text":"Say: \"Will the refund go back to my original payment method?\""},{"start":97.52,"end":100.06,"text":"or \"How long does the refund usually take?\""},{"start":100.88,"end":104.24,"text":"Shops handle this differently, so it is important to ask."},{"start":104.66,"end":110.34,"text":"The assistant cannot always give you an instant answer, but asking puts the information in front of you."}],"words":[{"text":"Before","start":0,"end":0.26},{"text":"you","start":0.26,"end":0.46},{"text":"go","start":0.46,"end":0.6},{"text":"to","start":0.6,"end":0.7},{"text":"the","start":0.7,"end":0.8},{"text":"shop","start":0.8,"end":1.06},{"text":"collect","start":1.44,"end":1.72},{"text":"your","start":1.72,"end":1.9},{"text":"evidence","start":1.9,"end":2.24},{"text":"You","start":2.9,"end":3.06},{"text":"need","start":3.06,"end":3.22},{"text":"the","start":3.22,"end":3.36},{"text":"order","start":3.36,"end":3.58},{"text":"confirmation","start":3.58,"end":4.02},{"text":"email","start":4.02,"end":4.56},{"text":"or","start":4.56,"end":5.22},{"text":"a","start":5.22,"end":5.4},{"text":"printed","start":5.4,"end":5.64},{"text":"order","start":5.64,"end":5.94},{"text":"number","start":5.94,"end":6.24},{"text":"You","start":6.84,"end":7.06},{"text":"also","start":7.06,"end":7.34},{"text":"need","start":7.34,"end":7.54},{"text":"the","start":7.54,"end":7.68},{"text":"original","start":7.68,"end":7.98},{"text":"packagin